{{Illusionnotes
| name = Rip Tide
| desc = All {{H|Naga Siren}}-based [[illusions]] have independent attack counters and only apply Rip Tide around themselves if they have this ability.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Attack Damage}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Tally}}
** The [[required attacks]] tally increases by 1 per successful attack on an enemy unit.
*** This includes both {{M|instant attack}} and {{M|secondary attack}} sources.
** {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}}
*** Once the tally counter reaches {{Symbol|Tally|{{#expr:{{#var:Rip Tide value1}}-1}}}} , the next successful attack procs all ability effects around Naga and her {{M|illusions}}, and the tally buff is removed.
*** The tally last indefinitely and persist {{M|death}}.
** {{Symbol|Target|Area-Inter}}
*** Multiple overlapping Rip Tide radius do not stack.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** The ability effects are applied as follows:
**# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|naga_siren_rip_tide}}
**# The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
**# Naga or the {{M|illusions}}' attack instance.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Rip Tide icon0}}
| desc = Naga Siren and her illusions deal bonus damage to enemies and reduce their armor for 4 seconds every 6 attacks.
}}

