 {{Illucraft|name=Naga Siren Mirror Image}}

* Applies the following ability effects on Naga as follows:
*# {{M|Disjoints}} incoming {{M|projectiles}} upon cast.
*# {{Symbol|Illusions}}
*#* Creates the Mirror Image-based [[illusions]] with {{Symbol|Invulnerable}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|modifier_[[invulnerable]]}}.
*#* The ability determines which position within the illusion formation that Naga will reappear at this point.
*# Applies the {{#var:Mirror Image value1}}-second split time {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|naga_siren_mirror_image}} with the following properties:
*#* {{M|Hidden}}
*#* {{M|Invulnerable}}
*#* {{M|Stun}}
*#* {{M|Unselectable}}
*# Given a stop-command, canceling all queued orders, including orders to other {{M|Summons|text=player-controlled units}}.
*# Applies a {{M|basic dispel}}.
*# {{Symbol|Illusions}}
*#* {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}}
*#** Reappears with Mirror Image-based illusions facing the same direction as Naga, correspondingly to the ability cast position and number of illusions created.
*#*** With 3 illusions: {{Symbol|Illusform|3a}} or {{Symbol|Illusform|3b1}} or {{Symbol|Illusform|3b2}}
*#*** {{Symbol|bonus t3l}} With {{ValueColor||4|20tal}} illusions: {{Symbol|Illusform|4a}} or {{Symbol|Illusform|4b1}} or {{Symbol|Illusform|4b2}}
*#** Naga's reappears in the aformentioned random position within the fixed formation.
*#* {{Symbol|Kill|Instant}}
*#** Recasting the ability [[instant kills]] and replaces all Mirror Image-based illusions of the current instance to the current ability level, regardless under whose control the illusions are.

* {{cf|expr}}
** Illusion Bounty: {{Code|{{G|illusion bounty level factor}} × [[Illusion#Bounty|Illusion]]<sub>LVL</sub>}}
** Illusion Spawn Distance: {{Code|Caster[[Collision Size|ColSize]] × (NumberOf[[Illusions]] + 2)}}
*** For Naga, the illusion spawn distance is {{calc|{{G|collision size hero}}*(v1+2)|v1=3}} ({{Symbol|bonus t3l}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|{{G|collision size hero}}*(v1+2)|v1=4}}|20tal}}).
*** {{Code|When Σ[[Illusion]]Created ≥ 3}}, two random illusions may be created in the same coordinates, with one of them pushed {{G|clear space distance}}-distance away.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Mirror Image icon0}}
| desc = Creates multiple images of Naga Siren under her control.
}}

