{{Debuffnotes
| name = Ensnare
| desc = The {{M|True Sight}} component fully affects [[debuff immune]] units.
}}
{{Draftnotes
| name = Ensnare
| desc = [[Toggling]] {{M|autocast}} off {{M|swaps-out}} this ability with {{A|Naga Siren|Reel In}}.<br><br>Both abilities have independent {{M|cooldowns}}.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** Applies the following ability effects on the affected enemy unit:
*** {{M|Root}}
*** Grants {{M|True Sight}} over the target.
** Affects the following units:
*** {{M|Couriers}}
*** {{A|Naga Siren|Song of the Siren}}-affected units.

* {{hi|Naga Siren}} {{Symbol|Illusions}}
** All of Naga's [[illusions]] within {{#var:Ensnare type1 value1}} range of the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy also casts a visual-only Ensnare with the following properties:
*** If they have no orders or standing still, the illusions {{M|Turn Rate|text=turn}}, {{M|Facing Angle|text=face}} the target, then cast the ability.
*** If they have move orders or attack orders, the orders continue until Ensnare's {{M|cast point}}, then overrides their current orders upon the ability's {{M|cast backswing}}.
*** When canceling the ability cast, they play the full {{M|cast animation}} but do not release the {{M|projectile}}.
<hr>
* {{cf|aghnotes}} Stacks additively with other percentage-based {{M|cast range}} sources.
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}}
*** Applies {{M|Break}} application upon projectile impact.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Ensnare icon0}}
| desc = Interrupts the target and traps them in place, preventing movement or blinking. Can target units affected by Song of the Siren.
}}

