 * Creates a {{M|aura}} upon cast centered around Naga that applies all ability effects for the entire duration.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** Applies the following ability effects to all affected enemy units, until woken up:
*** {{M|Sleep}}
**** Affected units are never automatically attacked.
**** {{M|Disarm}}
**** {{M|Invulnerability}}
**** {{M|Stun}}
*** {{M|Root}}
** Affects the following units:
*** {{M|Buildings}}
** Does not affect the following enemy units:
*** {{M|Couriers}}
*** {{M|Invulnerable}} units, unless the invulnerable source applied is Song of the SIren. 

* {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
** Grants max health as {{M|health regeneration}} bonus to allied units within the radius.
** Affects the following allied units:
*** {{M|Invulnerable}} units.
** Does not affect the following allied units:
*** {{M|Buildings|x}}

* Does not affect the following units of any {{M|factions}}:
** {{M|Hidden}} units.
** {{M|Ward-type units}}.

* Only the following sources can interrupt the ability:
** Upon {{A|Naga Siren|Song of the Siren}} {{M|sub-ability}} cast.
** Upon Naga's {{M|death}}.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Song of the Siren icon0}}
| desc = All enemies in range of the Naga Siren are put into a magical stasis where they cannot act or be attacked. Using Song of the Siren again will end the duration early.
}}

